    "detailed_description": "Grab your Bag, pick up the Numbering Rod, look for the backboard on the ground that flashes black and white numbers, and stand on it at the right time:<br />\r\nThe backplane with a white background can be used to charge a number to the Numbering Rod, and you can open the Bag to see the number on the Numbering Rod.<br />\r\nA backplane with a black background will reduce the number of Numbering Rod, so avoid it.<br />\r\nWave the Numbering Rod and give the sheep a number, remember to charge the Numbering Rod that consumes the number.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is intended to express disengagement, contemplation, doubt, the one percent, hypnosis, wandering, and distress.",
